---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /hub.html
activeNav: hub
activeSection: hub
title: Player Hub
summary: "Evergreen pages for mobile players, kept up to date: patch trackers, tier lists, redeem codes and guides, each built from official sources."
---
{% from "macros.njk" import card with context %}
<div class="page">
<div class="lab mono"><span class="n">/ PLAYER HUB</span><span>KEPT UP TO DATE</span><span class="ln"></span></div>
<h1>Player Hub</h1>
<p class="lead" style="margin:10px 0 20px;max-width:680px">News tells you what changed. The hub is where you check what is true right now: every page shows when we last checked it against the official source.</p>
{% for h in hubTypes %}{% set items = collections.hub | byHubType(h.slug) %}{% if items.length %}
<div class="lab mono" style="margin-top:22px"><span>{{ h.name | upper }}</span><span class="ln"></span><a href="{{ ('/hub/' + h.slug + '.html') | rel }}">All {{ h.name | lower }}</a></div>
<div class="grid">{% for n in items | limit(6) %}{{ card(n, pre) }}{% endfor %}</div>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
